WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.290
This video shows where every lead stands, and how to read your numbers.

00:00:04.440 --> 00:00:13.893
Leads centre is a board with one column for each stage, from first message to won. Each card is a lead. A red mark means it needs a person.

00:00:14.043 --> 00:00:21.661
Click a lead to open it without leaving the board. You see the details on the right, and you can reply from the chat at the bottom.

00:00:21.811 --> 00:00:29.578
Stages and tags is where you make the pipeline your own. Rename a stage, add one, or remove one you do not use.

00:00:29.728 --> 00:00:37.303
Tags work the same way. Give a tag a rule, in plain words, and the AI applies it only when that rule is met.

00:00:37.453 --> 00:00:46.309
Insights starts with what to do next. It reads your numbers and tells you, in a sentence or two, the change that would book the most extra calls.

00:00:46.459 --> 00:00:54.141
Below that is your forecast for the month against your target, then the funnel, showing where leads drop off between each stage.

00:00:54.291 --> 00:01:03.615
That is the whole tool. Get connected, fill in your brief, and work the inbox. You can watch any of these videos again from Video guides in the menu.
